{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break.\u00a0Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1757959428\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Lives on Your Desktop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A transparent, resizable window you can place anywhere.\u00a0Drag, resize, and let the fox keep you company over your work or study apps.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.poster.avif?t=1757959428\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.webm?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/7fb258c429158e7be12b6627aa5c9b9f.mp4?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Make It Yours</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock decoration sets with small, satisfying bonuses, then add upgrades that keep the fire thriving. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Quiet Progress, Warm Sound</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Soft clinks and ember glow keep pace without pressure. No fail states, just cozy gains at your pace.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1757959428","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3954800?t=1757959428","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/4f770ec823e637cad37a09a7e41ce667e3c81c72/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757959428","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/4f770ec823e637cad37a09a7e41ce667e3c81c72/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757959428","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cozy Typing Companion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your fox quietly keeps camp while you type, click, or take a break.\u00a0Your activity fills an energy meter that nudges the fox to gather wood, stoke the fire, and toast marshmallows; step away and a gentle deep-idle trickles in coins so progress never stops.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.poster.avif?t=1757959428\" width=616 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.webm?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3954800/extras/f03f9fc827d73b318a6d6c045be4eb7c.mp4?t=1757959428\" type=\"video/mp4\"></vid